---
import metrics from '../data/metrics.json';
---

<section id="descargar" class="py-28 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <div class="animate-slide-up">
    <div class="section-divider mb-6"></div>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Descargar y Probar</h2>
    <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-lg max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
      Transitly es open source (MIT). Descarga el APK, explora el código fuente o despliega tu propia instancia.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-14">
    <a
      href="https://github.com/astralk9999/Transitly/releases/download/v1.0.0-tfg/app-release.apk"
      class="glass-card-raised p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:border-transit-accent/40 transition-all duration-300 animate-slide-up animation-delay-100"
      download
    >
      <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-transit-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-transit-accent/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="18" y2="18.01"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">APK Android</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mb-4">
        Versión {metrics.release.version} · {metrics.release.apkSize} · {metrics.release.androidMin}
      </p>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-transit-accent text-white rounded-full text-sm font-semibold group-hover:bg-transit-accent/85 transition-all">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="15" y2="3"/></svg>
        Descargar APK
      </span>
    </a>

    <a
      href="https://github.com/astralk9999/Transitly"
      class="glass-card-raised p-8 flex flex-col items-center text-center group hover:border-transit-accent/40 transition-all duration-300 animate-slide-up animation-delay-200"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-transit-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-transit-accent/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Código Fuente</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm mb-4">
        github.com/astralk9999/Transitly · Licencia MIT
      </p>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 border border-transit-accent/30 text-transit-text-hi rounded-full text-sm font-semibold group-hover:bg-transit-accent-bg transition-all">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" x2="21" y1="14" y2="3"/></svg>
        Ver repositorio
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="glass-card p-8 mt-8 animate-slide-up animation-delay-300">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4">Instalación</h3>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-transit-accent shrink-0">1</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Descarga el APK</p>
          <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-xs">Pulsa el botón "Descargar APK" desde tu dispositivo Android.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-transit-accent shrink-0">2</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Permite orígenes desconocidos</p>
          <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-xs">Android te pedirá confirmación para instalar apps fuera de Play Store. Concede el permiso temporalmente.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-transit-accent shrink-0">3</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Inicia sesión o explora como invitado</p>
          <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-xs">Crea una cuenta con email/password o usa el modo invitado con datos mock de {metrics.context.operator} ({metrics.context.city}).</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <span class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-transit-accent shrink-0">4</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Explora el transporte de tu ciudad</p>
          <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-xs">Mapa interactivo, tarjeta NFC, incidencias y comunidad. Todo desde una app.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center mt-8 animate-slide-up animation-delay-400">
    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-transit-text-mid border border-transit-bg-raised">
      ~{metrics.project.dartFiles} ficheros .dart
    </span>
    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-transit-text-mid border border-transit-bg-raised">
      ~{metrics.project.loc} LOC
    </span>
    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-transit-text-mid border border-transit-bg-raised">
      CI {metrics.ci.jobs} jobs verde
    </span>
    <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-transit-bg-raised/60 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-transit-text-mid border border-transit-bg-raised">
      MIT License
    </span>
  </div>
</section>
